<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n53369" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καρκῐν-όω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>make crab-like</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. τοὺς
				δακτύλους</span>
			<i>crook</i> one's fingers <i>like crab's claws</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Antiph.
				55.15
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, of roots, <i>spread crab-wise</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				1.6.3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>CP</u>
				3.21.5
			</span></i>:—also in 
				Act.
			, <i>cause to spread</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ
				Χειμὼν πιλώσας καὶ καρκινώσας τὰς ῥίζας</span>
				ib.<i><span class="en">
				3.23.5
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> in 
				Pass.
			, also, <i>suffer from cancer</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Nat.Mul.</u>
				31
			</span></i>; <i>become cancerous</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκινδύνευσεν καρκινωθῆναι τὰ ἕλκεα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Mul.</u>
					1.40
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
